# The app's environment contract: declare here the variables YOUR app adds, so that
# `./oliva env init` and the env checks know about them. Oliva never changes this file.
#
# Same format as scripts/oliva/env.manifest (Oliva's own variables; read its header):
#
#   NAME   SLOT   KIND   VALUE
#
# Examples:
#   MAILER_DSN          backend   secret   -            # a person provides it; never committed
#   WEBHOOK_SIGNING_KEY backend   secret   gen:hex32    # `env init` generates it
#   APP_PUBLIC_URL      backend   plain    -
#
# Rule: a variable marked secret lives in .env only (gitignored), with a placeholder in
# .env.example. Never in .env.backend or any other tracked file.
